 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1593490955" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"> <h2 class="m-size-24 size-30"><span class="m-font-size-24 font-size-30" style="color: rgb(11, 61, 44); display: unset;">Leave It To Our Landscapers</span></h2> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1865058645" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: initial;">Our skilled team is eager to help you achieve and maintain the perfect lawn. We offer a wide variety of services designed to restore, tidy and enhance your lawn. You can hire our lawn and landscaping company to handle...</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1181781459" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1181781459" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Lawn mowing services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1780593292" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1780593292" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Lawn fertilization treatment services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1690750194" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1690750194" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Retaining wall installations</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1525999001" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1525999001" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Flower bed installations</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1211703552" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1211703552" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Sod installation services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1552655629" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1552655629" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Lawn seeding installation services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1753073212" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1753073212" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;" data-quillbot-parent="5-x9-8mE9hPPjCWiT43vt"><p><span style="display: unset;">Residential &amp; Commercial snow removal services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph u_1148338191" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1148338191" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Leaf cleanup and removal services</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1305594288" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">We also offer sod installation and lawn seeding - some of our most popular services. Call us today to get a free quote, and be sure to ask about our military discount.</span></p></div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="u_1991188686 dmRespRow" id="1991188686"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1091747426"> <div class="dmRespCol large-12 medium-12 small-12" id="1700306814"> <div class="u_1866360481 dmDividerWrapper clearfix" data-element-type="dDividerId" data-layout="divider-style-1" data-widget-version="2" id="1866360481" data-anim-extended="eyJkZXNrdG9wIjp7InRyaWdnZXIiOiJlbnRyYW5jZSIsImFuaW1hdGlvbiI6InNsaWRlSW5SaWdodCIsInJldmVyc2UiOmZhbHNlfX0=" data-anim-desktop="slideInRight"><hr class="dmDivider" style="border-width:2px; border-top-style:solid; color:grey;" id="1983459288"/></div> 
 <div class="u_1413420968 dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1413420968" style="transition: none 0s ease 0s; text-align: left; display: block;"> <h2 class="m-text-align-center"><span style="color: rgb(11, 61, 44); display: unset;">What Our Customers Are Saying!</span></h2> 
</div> 
 <div class="imageWidget align-center u_1446262459" data-element-type="image" data-widget-type="image" id="1446262459"> <a href="https://search.google.com/local/writereview?placeid=ChIJGQA3XouYzKER4llqB5yrhgs" id="1367457541" class="" target="_blank" file="false"><img src="https://lirp.cdn-website.com/4e8bfbc9/dms3rep/multi/opt/google_review_button-292w.png" alt="Click here to leave us a review on Google" id="1292561653" class="" data-dm-image-path="https://irp.cdn-website.com/4e8bfbc9/dms3rep/multi/google_review_button.png" width="1492" height="463" onerror="handleImageLoadError(this)"/></a> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespRow u_1184806568" id="1184806568"> <div class="dmRespColsWrapper" id="1531974345"> <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1798011829" id="1798011829"> <div class="u_1653463528 graphicWidget" data-element-type="graphic" data-widget-type="graphic" id="1653463528"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 1664 1792" id="1090821281" class="svg u_1090821281" data-icon-name="fa-quote-left"> <path fill="inherit" d="M768 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136zM1664 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136z"></path> 
</svg> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1628325735" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Incredible family business that is passionate about what they do. They are flexible to work with your schedule and what you need. Could not recommend them enough if your looking for assistance with yard work!</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1700074420" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"> <h3><span style="color: rgb(27, 135, 72); display: unset;">Allison E.</span></h3> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol small-12 large-4 medium-4 u_1750293876" id="1750293876"> <div class="u_1568820345 graphicWidget" data-element-type="graphic" data-widget-type="graphic" id="1568820345"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 1664 1792" id="1215597709" class="svg u_1215597709" data-icon-name="fa-quote-left"> <path fill="inherit" d="M768 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136zM1664 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136z"></path> 
</svg> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1848896620" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">We contacted Landon Saturday and he was able to come take care of our lawn the very next day! To give you an idea our back yard hadn't been cut in about 3 weeks. He came and mowed with zero concerns or complaints about the jungle yard. The edging looks immaculate and the crisp lines in the yard are impressive! We will be seeing him every week from now on! It's amazing to have one less thing for hubby to do on his 2 days off. Thank you for giving us more family time and a yard to enjoy that time in!</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1836412079" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"> <h3><span style="color: rgb(27, 135, 72); display: unset;">Lindsey A.</span></h3> 
</div> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmRespCol large-4 medium-4 small-12 u_1744785468" id="1744785468"> <div class="u_1285970335 graphicWidget" data-element-type="graphic" data-widget-type="graphic" id="1285970335"> <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewbox="0 0 1664 1792" id="1506922557" class="svg u_1506922557" data-icon-name="fa-quote-left"> <path fill="inherit" d="M768 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136zM1664 960v384q0 80-56 136t-136 56h-384q-80 0-136-56t-56-136v-704q0-104 40.5-198.5t109.5-163.5 163.5-109.5 198.5-40.5h64q26 0 45 19t19 45v128q0 26-19 45t-45 19h-64q-106 0-181 75t-75 181v32q0 40 28 68t68 28h224q80 0 136 56t56 136z"></path> 
</svg> 
</div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1115996277" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"><p><span style="display: unset;">Cutting Edge Services is great! I would highly recommend them for any of your lawn care needs. They are extremely responsive and always quick to respond to any questions I have. They do a great job on my lawn, are prompt every week, and do a great job cleaning up when they are done. Highly recommend them!!</span></p></div> 
 <div class="dmNewParagraph" data-element-type="paragraph" data-version="5" id="1683625387" style="transition: opacity 1s ease-in-out 0s;"> <h3><span style="color: rgb(27, 135, 72); display: unset;">Kelli N.</span></h3> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
